{"id":28400,"author":"minertedtoad","body":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e[REFEREE]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eIGN: Minertedtoad\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eDiscord( Name#): @officalMinertedtoad#8335\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eTimezone: Greenwich mean time\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eWhy would you like to join the referee team(brief paragraph):\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eI would like to join the referee team because I personally think that I would be able to do the job well. I know the rules like the back of my hand and also I am good at asking people not to do stuff. On the other hand I am good at refereeing games IRL so I think that I would also be good in game.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eBest time of the week?:\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eThe best time for me is weekdays 5pm - 9pm except Wednesdays week-ends 4pm-9pm apart from if I give prior notice\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eA paragraph or two to tell us something about yourself(Pretend you are trying to sell yourself to us):\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eFirst of all I am good at enforcing the rules and this would be good because I would need to enforce them if a team is breaking them. Next, I am quite good at team work. This would be helpful because I might need to support a fellow referee and if you don't have good teamwork skills this might be a problem for you.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eOn the other hand, I am not good at spotting hackers. This would give me a disadvantage however I would be able to ask another referee for help but also if they are blatant then I wouldn't need help. Finally, I have always wanted to be part of a team that helps people on the server and I would really like to get this position to do that.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eAnything else?: I would like to say thank you for this opportunity for letting me apply. This has been a good experience so far and I hope to go on along way from here.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eI know my punishments don't look good but I have been trying my real hardest to get away from them and become a better person.\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eThanks:\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eMinertedtoad :)\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e[REFEREE]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eIGN: Minertedtoad\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eDiscord( Name#): @officalMinertedtoad#8335\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eTimezone: Greenwich