bout yourself(Pretend you are trying to sell yourself to us):\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eFirst of all I am good at enforcing the rules and this would be good because I would need to enforce them if a team is breaking them. Next, I am quite good at team work. This would be helpful because I might need to support a fellow referee and if you don't have good teamwork skills this might be a problem for you.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eOn the other hand, I am not good at spotting hackers. This would give me a disadvantage however I would be able to ask another referee for help but also if they are blatant then I wouldn't need help. Finally, I have always wanted to be part of a team that helps people on the server and I would really like to get this position to do that.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eAnything else?: I would like to say thank you for this opportunity for letting me apply. This has been a good experience so far and I hope to go on along way from here.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eI know my punishments don't look good but I have been trying my real hardest to get away from them and become a better person.\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eThanks:\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003eMinertedtoad :)\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","created_at":1507132774,"title":"[X] [REF] minertedtoad","replies":[{"id":383128,"author":"PokerFace","body":"Hello minertedtoad,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUnfortunately, we have decided to deny your application. The main reason being the amount of recent punishments. If you can improve your in-game behavior, you will be more likely to become a referee.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThank you for applying!\u003cbr\u003e-PokerFace","body_tagged":"Hello minertedtoad,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUnfortunately, we have decided to deny your application. The main reason being the amount of recent punishments. If you can improve your in-game behavior, you will be more likely to become a referee.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThank you for applying!\u003cbr\u003e-PokerFace","created_at":1508663225}]}